  "items": [
    {
      "source": "<code>connection</code> - the R2DBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> to hold",
      "translation": "<code>connection</code> - 用于保存 R2DBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> 的连接。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "This will be the same <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> until <code>released</code> gets called\non the <a href=\"ConnectionHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.r2dbc.connection\"><code>ConnectionHolder</code></a>, which will reset the held <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>,\nfetching a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> on demand.",
      "translation": "这将保持为相同的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>，直到在 <a href=\"ConnectionHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.r2dbc.connection\"><code>ConnectionHolder</code></a> 上调用 <code>released</code>，这将重置持有的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>，并在需要时按需获取新的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Used for releasing the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> on suspend\n(with a <code>null</code> argument) and setting a fresh <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> on resume.",
      "translation": "用于在挂起时释放带有<code>null</code>参数的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>，并在恢复时设置一个新的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Inherits rollback-only support for nested R2DBC transactions and reference\ncount functionality from the base class.",
      "translation": "继承自基类的嵌套 R2DBC 事务的仅回滚支持以及引用计数功能。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the current <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> held by this <a href=\"ConnectionHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.r2dbc.connection\"><code>ConnectionHolder</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回此<a href=\"ConnectionHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.r2dbc.connection\"><code>ConnectionHolder</code></a>持有的当前<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new ConnectionHolder for the given R2DBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>,\nassuming that there is no ongoing transaction.",
      "translation": "为给定的 R2DBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> 创建一个新的 ConnectionHolder，假设没有正在进行的交易。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new ConnectionHolder for the given R2DBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 R2DBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> 创建一个新的 ConnectionHolder。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return whether this holder currently has a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回此 Holder 当前是否包含一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Releases the current <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>.",
      "translation": "释放当前的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Clear the transactional state of this resource holder.",
      "translation": "清除此资源持有者的事务状态。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return whether this holder represents an active, R2DBC-managed transaction.",
      "translation": "返回该持有者是否表示一个活跃的、由 R2DBC 管理的交易。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set whether this holder represents an active, R2DBC-managed transaction.",
      "translation": "设置此持有者是否表示一个活跃的、由 R2DBC 管理的交易。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>transactionActive</code> - whether the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> is involved\nin an ongoing transaction",
      "translation": "<code>transactionActive</code> - 指示给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> 是否参与正在进行的交易",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note: This is an SPI class, not intended to be used by applications.",
      "translation": "注意：这是一个 SPI 类，不打算供应用程序使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"../../transaction/support/ResourceHolderSupport.html#clear()\">ResourceHolderSupport</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从类复制：<code><a href=\"../../transaction/support/ResourceHolderSupport.html#clear()\">ResourceHolderSupport</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Override the existing Connection with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>.",
      "translation": "覆盖现有的连接，使用给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../transaction/support/ResourceHolderSupport.html#released()\">released</a></code> in class <code><a href=\"../../transaction/support/ResourceHolderSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.support\">ResourceHolderSupport</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../transaction/support/ResourceHolderSupport.html#released()\">released</a></code>` 在类 `<code><a href=\"../../transaction/support/ResourceHolderSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.support\">ResourceHolderSupport</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../transaction/support/ResourceHolderSupport.html#clear()\">clear</a></code> in class <code><a href=\"../../transaction/support/ResourceHolderSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.support\">ResourceHolderSupport</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../transaction/support/ResourceHolderSupport.html#clear()\">clear</a></code>` 类中的 `<code><a href=\"../../transaction/support/ResourceHolderSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.support\">ResourceHolderSupport</a></code>`",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Mark Paluch, Christoph Strobl",
